OL,4,CMysterious Mercury is about to get a   
OL,5,Cvisitor - after spacecraft's eight-    
OL,6,Cyear epic voyage                       
OL,7,GAfter an eight-year journey travelling 
OL,8,Galmost six billion miles (10bn km), a  
OL,9,Gspacecraft called BepiColombo is about 
OL,10,Gto reach its final destination and get 
OL,11,Ginto orbit around Mercury.             
OL,13,FIt will be entering an extremely       
OL,14,Fhostile environment: Mercury is the    
OL,15,Fclosest planet to the Sun and          
OL,16,Ftemperatures can reach a fierce 430C   
OL,17,Fand then plunge to -180C, and it is    
OL,18,Fconstantly blasted with intense solar  
OL,19,Fradiation.                             
